  "name": "Rebounding Shots",
  "type": "feat",
  "img": "icons/skills/melee/hand-grip-sword-red.webp",
  "system": {
    "description": {
      "value": "<p>Starting at 7th level, when you miss with a ranged weapon attack using special ammunition, the ammunition is not expended. Additionally, when you hit a target with a ranged weapon attack, you can cause the projectile to ricochet to another target within 15 feet of the original target. Make a second attack roll against the new target. On a hit, it takes half the damage of the original attack.</p>\n<p>You can use the ricochet a number of times equal to your Intelligence modifier (minimum of once), and you regain all expended uses when you finish a short or long rest.</p>",
